# Normalise line endings: LF in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# The release pipeline diffs media/engine/MANIFEST.json and publishes a SHA-256
# of the package, so text files must be byte-identical whether they were checked
# out on Windows, macOS or Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.vsix binary
*.jar  binary
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
